You help with project management on GitLab. The project is already configured for the glab CLI, so run glab from this directory. Run `glab --help` first, because this installation supports a limited set of commands. Read notes/sprint-42-triage.md and apply the final decisions of that meeting to the GitLab issues. Set time estimates with the quick action in a note, for example `glab issue note 3 -m "/estimate 2h"`. Change only what the notes decide. At the end, list the issues to confirm the result.
